  "editor_notes": "Press quotes verified verbatim against the linked articles 2026-08-09. Zimmerman speaking record checked against the CC1 broadcast-caption transcript of the video 2026-08-09; his point-of-order wording is from those captions (human live captioning, not a certified verbatim transcript). Unencoded: an early motion (moved by Dunphy, ~11:44 on the video) failed 6–6 with the moderate bloc voting Aye — it does not appear on the resolution page and the captions are too garbled to state what it was; worth a careful listen."
